### Lab 4: Shopping cart — add, update, retrieve, remove product
### Add product(s) to a user's cart
curl -i -X PUT http://127.0.0.1:8098/buckets/shopping_carts/keys/U101 \
  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  -d '{"user_id":"U101","items":[{"product_id":"P01","quantity":2,"price":499},{"product_id":"P02","quantity":1,"price":199}],"total":1197}'

### Retrieve cart
curl -i http://127.0.0.1:8098/buckets/shopping_carts/keys/U101

### Update quantity and total (application writes whole cart value)
curl -i -X PUT http://127.0.0.1:8098/buckets/shopping_carts/keys/U101 \
  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  -d '{"user_id":"U101","items":[{"product_id":"P01","quantity":3,"price":499},{"product_id":"P02","quantity":1,"price":199}],"total":1696}'

### Remove product P02 by writing cart without it
curl -i -X PUT http://127.0.0.1:8098/buckets/shopping_carts/keys/U101 \
  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  -d '{"user_id":"U101","items":[{"product_id":"P01","quantity":3,"price":499}],"total":1497}'
